data: {"id": "d59a7f83796c49ed-thinking-parallel_evidence-1691", "run_id": "d59a7f83796c49ed", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮工具调用已完成，关键事实已采集。以下是针对 `aiops-case-11/workload` 的证据汇总、冲突分析及缺口。\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-11/workload`\n- **UID**: `00030ff2-85db-453a-808d-4293aba8f20c`\n- **IP**: `172.16.104.23`\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **阶段**: `Running` (但处于 Terminating 状态)\n\n### 2. 支持 TerminatingStuck 的事实\n- **deletionTimestamp 存在**: YAML 显示 `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，且 Prometheus `kube_pod_deletion_timestamp` 指标确认该时间戳存在且稳定（Value: `1788474663`）。\n- **Finalizer 阻塞**: YAML 明确列出 `finalizers: aiops.lab/hold`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788477640051, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

