aiops.lab/hold`。Kubelet 已成功终止了容器（`exit_code 137`），但 Kubernetes API Server 在等待该 Finalizer 对应的清理钩子完成后才会真正从集群移除该 Pod。\n\n**证据支持：**\n*   容器异常终止且未重启（`exit_code: 137`, `restarts: 0`, `last_terminated_reason: Error`）证明了应用确实在运行过程中死亡，触发了清理流程。\n*   Pod 处于 `Running` 状态（`phase: Running`）说明它并未处于 Pending（调度失败）状态，而是处于正在被删除但尚未从 API Server 摘除的过渡期，这是 Finalizer 阻塞的典型特征。\n\n**已知未知（证据不足部分）：**\n目前无法确认 `aiops.lab/hold` 具体为何未能完成清理。缺失的决定性事实包括：\n1. 负责处理 `aiops.lab/hold` 的后端控制器（或 Operator）的运行日志（Logging 采集为空）。\n2. 该 Finalizer 绑定的上游资源或清理逻辑的拓扑依赖关系（`kubectl lineage` 工具调用失败）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 60.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 60.7s (Evidence 52.4s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 98.658, "metrics": {"run_id": "d59a7f83796c49ed", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 98.66587448120117, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook